    {
      "id": "over",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "<p><strong>Overview.</strong> Players stopped caring about drops after their twentieth run. The loop was generous early and flat forever after.</p>"
    },
    { "id": "h-goals", "type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Goals" },
    {
      "id": "goals",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "<ul><li>Keep the twentieth run as tense as the second</li><li>Shorten runs without cutting content</li><li>Give the team numbers they can read without me</li></ul>"
    },
